OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment to be asked for advice 
OL,4,Aon homes plan                          
OL,6,FThe government will be asked to get    
OL,7,Finvolved in a planning decision for 150
OL,8,Fhomes due to fears it will exacerbate a
OL,9,Ftown's flooding issues.                
OL,11,FNorth Norfolk District Council's       
OL,12,Fplanning committee deferred a decision 
OL,13,Fon the Ingham Road housing estate in   
OL,14,FStalham on Thursday.                   
OL,16,FAnglian Water had objected to the      
OL,17,Fproposals, saying its sewage network   
OL,18,Fwould not be able to accommodate the   
OL,19,Fadditional demand and there would be an
OL,20,F"unacceptable risk of flooding".       
