OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment to be asked for advice 
OL,4,Aon homes plan                          
OL,6,FWith the water company saying it has no
OL,7,Fcurrent plans to invest in improving   
OL,8,Fits services in the area, the committee
OL,9,Fdecided to write to Housing Minister   
OL,10,FMatthew Pennycook to ask for advice.   
